+"""Prove the qualified stock-font Writer PDF for the source-bound ODT/v02 list.
+
+The caller uses the same PDF bytes for qpdf inspection, native receipt binding,
+this proof and publication. This profile is specific to the tagged one-page
+Writer output with two Liberation Serif subsets.
